# Preferred R dependencies (this project)

| Task | Package |
|------|---------|
| Project library | `renv` |
| Paths | `here`, `fs` |
| Tabular | `dplyr`, `tidyr`, `tibble` (`data.table` if needed) |
| Single-cell | `Seurat`, `SingleCellExperiment` |
| Bulk / DE | `SummarizedExperiment`, `DESeq2`, `edgeR` |
| GRN / GGM | `huge` (graphical lasso) as in DeCovarT vignettes |
| Deconvolution | `DeCovarT` |
| Feature search | `mco` (NSGA-II); optional `GA` / `GenSA` |
| Plotting | `ggplot2`, `patchwork`; `tinytable` in the book |
| Parallel Monte Carlo | `furrr` |
| Strings / checks | `glue`, `stringr`, `checkmate` |

Match `renv.lock` when adding packages. Do not introduce unused
dependencies.
